<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="3322200148"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1855955698"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="LUZ ROJA"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="bxkq"/><amll:meta key="album" value="LUZ ROJA"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="01:45.160"><div begin="00:00.020" end="01:45.160"><p begin="00:00.020" end="00:01.920" itunes:key="L1">Luz roja, no pares<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使遇到红灯 也不要停止 因为时光无法倒流</span></p><p begin="00:01.920" end="00:03.580" itunes:key="L2">Que el tiempo no sabe volver</p><p begin="00:03.580" end="00:05.890" itunes:key="L3">Tus labios mandan señales<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的嘴唇传递着信号 我的身体却无法理解</span></p><p begin="00:05.890" end="00:07.600" itunes:key="L4">Mi cuerpo no puede entender</p><p begin="00:07.600" end="00:09.140" itunes:key="L5">Luz roja y me arde<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">红灯亮起 无需触碰 也不用许下承诺 却能够灼烧着我的心灵</span></p><p begin="00:09.140" end="00:11.460" itunes:key="L6">Sin tocarme, sin prometer</p><p begin="00:11.460" end="00:13.560" itunes:key="L7">Bailando somos rivales<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纵情热舞 我们就像是敌人 最终谁会情不自禁地沦陷</span></p><p begin="00:13.560" end="00:15.490" itunes:key="L8">Pero al final, ¿quién va a caer?</p><p begin="00:15.490" end="00:17.230" itunes:key="L9">Eh, eh-eh-eh</p><p begin="00:17.230" end="00:19.180" itunes:key="L10">Eh, eh-eh-eh</p><p begin="00:19.180" end="00:21.180" itunes:key="L11">Eh, eh-eh-eh</p><p begin="00:21.180" end="00:22.960" itunes:key="L12">Pero al final, ¿quién va a caer?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最终谁会情不自禁地沦陷</span></p><p begin="00:22.960" end="00:24.930" itunes:key="L13">Eh, eh-eh-eh</p><p begin="00:24.930" end="00:26.730" itunes:key="L14">Eh, eh-eh-eh</p><p begin="00:26.730" end="00:28.640" itunes:key="L15">Eh, eh-eh-eh</p><p begin="00:28.640" end="00:30.970" itunes:key="L16">Pero al final, ¿quién va a caer?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最终谁会情不自禁地沦陷</span></p><p begin="00:30.970" end="00:32.850" itunes:key="L17">Tú juegas con mi gravedad<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你令我神魂颠倒 倘若你离去 我将会丧失理智</span></p><p begin="00:32.850" end="00:34.790" itunes:key="L18">Su voz me deja sin paz<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使双眼不愿停下 心却早已随你而去</span></p><p begin="00:34.790" end="00:36.280" itunes:key="L19">Y aunque el beat no quiere parar<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使这音乐不曾停止 我的心已经追随着你</span></p><p begin="00:36.280" end="00:38.530" itunes:key="L20">Mi mente ya se va detrás</p><p begin="00:38.530" end="00:40.460" itunes:key="L21">Tú juegas con mi gravedad<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你令我神魂颠倒 倘若你离去 我将会丧失理智</span></p><p begin="00:40.460" end="00:42.300" itunes:key="L22">Su voz me deja sin paz<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使双眼不愿停下 心却早已随你而去</span></p><p begin="00:42.300" end="00:43.870" itunes:key="L23">Y aunque el beat no quiere parar<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使这音乐不曾停止 我的心已经追随着你</span></p><p begin="00:43.870" end="00:49.480" itunes:key="L24">Mi mente ya se va detrás</p><p begin="00:49.480" end="00:51.310" itunes:key="L25">Suelta el miedo, no digas nada<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">放下心中的恐惧 无需多言</span></p><p begin="00:51.310" end="00:57.170" itunes:key="L26">El sudor cuenta la verdad<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">汗水诉说着真相</span></p><p begin="00:57.170" end="00:59.100" itunes:key="L27">Si el deseo es quien manda<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">倘若欲望主宰一切</span></p><p begin="00:59.100" end="01:01.250" itunes:key="L28">No hay pecado en tropezar<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使跌倒也不用承担过错</span></p><p begin="01:01.250" end="01:03.040" itunes:key="L29">Eh, eh-eh-eh</p><p begin="01:03.040" end="01:04.950" itunes:key="L30">Eh, eh-eh-eh</p><p begin="01:04.950" end="01:06.770" itunes:key="L31">Eh, eh-eh-eh</p><p begin="01:06.770" end="01:08.780" itunes:key="L32">Pero al final, ¿quién va a caer?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最终谁会情不自禁地沦陷</span></p><p begin="01:08.780" end="01:10.440" itunes:key="L33">Eh, eh-eh-eh</p><p begin="01:10.440" end="01:12.470" itunes:key="L34">Eh, eh-eh-eh</p><p begin="01:12.470" end="01:14.470" itunes:key="L35">Eh, eh-eh-eh</p><p begin="01:14.470" end="01:16.180" itunes:key="L36">Pero al final, ¿quién va a caer?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最终谁会情不自禁地沦陷</span></p><p begin="01:16.180" end="01:17.930" itunes:key="L37">Luz roja, no pares<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使遇到红灯 也不要停止 因为时光无法倒流</span></p><p begin="01:17.930" end="01:19.930" itunes:key="L38">Que el tiempo no sabe volver</p><p begin="01:19.930" end="01:21.980" itunes:key="L39">Tus labios mandan señales<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的嘴唇传递着信号 我的身体却无法理解</span></p><p begin="01:21.980" end="01:23.860" itunes:key="L40">Mi cuerpo no puede entender</p><p begin="01:23.860" end="01:25.320" itunes:key="L41">Luz roja y me arde<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">红灯亮起 无需触碰 也不用许下承诺 却能够灼烧着我的心灵</span></p><p begin="01:25.320" end="01:27.670" itunes:key="L42">Sin tocarme, sin prometer</p><p begin="01:27.670" end="01:29.620" itunes:key="L43">Bailando somos rivales<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纵情热舞 我们就像是敌人 最终谁会情不自禁地沦陷</span></p><p begin="01:29.620" end="01:31.860" itunes:key="L44">Pero al final, ¿quién va a caer?</p><p begin="01:31.860" end="01:33.600" itunes:key="L45">Eh, eh-eh-eh</p><p begin="01:33.600" end="01:35.370" itunes:key="L46">Eh, eh-eh-eh</p><p begin="01:35.370" end="01:37.230" itunes:key="L47">Eh, eh-eh-eh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但到最后 谁会先沦陷</span></p><p begin="01:37.230" end="01:39.460" itunes:key="L48">Pero al final, ¿quién va a caer?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最终谁会情不自禁地沦陷</span></p><p begin="01:39.460" end="01:41.060" itunes:key="L49">Eh, eh-eh-eh</p><p begin="01:41.060" end="01:42.910" itunes:key="L50">Eh, eh-eh-eh</p><p begin="01:42.910" end="01:44.990" itunes:key="L51">Eh, eh-eh-eh</p><p begin="01:44.990" end="01:45.160" itunes:key="L52">Pero al final, ¿quién va a caer?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最终谁会情不自禁地沦陷</span></p></div></body></tt>